‘What do you do? Tim Ferriss has trouble answering the question. Depending on when you ask this
controversial Princeton University guest lecturer, he might answer:
"I race motorcycles in Europe."
"I ski in the Andes."
"I scuba dive in Panama."
"I dance tango in Buenos Aires."
He has spent more than five years learning the secrets of the New Rich, a fast-growing subculture who has abandoned the "deferred-life plan" and instead mastered the new currencies-time and mobility-to create luxury lifestyles in the here and now.
Whether you are an overworked employee or an entrepreneur trapped in your own business, this book is the compass for a new and revolutionary world. Join Tim Ferriss as he teaches you:
* How to outsource your life to overseas virtual assistants for $5 per hour and do whatever you want
* How blue-chip escape artists travel the world without quitting their jobs
* How to eliminate 50% of your work in 48 hours using the principles of a forgotten Italian economist
* How to trade a long-haul career for short work bursts and freuent "mini-retirements"
* What the crucial difference is between absolute and relative income
* How to train your boss to value performance over presence, or kill your job (or company) if it's beyond repair
* What automated cash-flow "muses" are and how to create one in 2 to 4 weeks
* How to cultivate selective ignorance-and create time--with a low-information diet
* What the management secrets of Remote Control CEOs are
* How to get free housing worldwide and airfare at 50-80% off
* How to fill the void and create a meaningful life after removing work and the office
You can have it all-really. "From the Hardcover edition.""¥
¢Imenata, vremenata i sluchkite, opisani v knigata, sa realni. Ne s'm promenila nishcho ot tova, koeto nauchikh, dokato v'rviakh po p'tia k'm kraia na tozi roman. Toi be zapochnat prez 2006 g. Pochti dve godini ne uspiakh da napisha nishcho drugo osven istoriiata za Khalil i Giulten, Nurten i Mustafa. Strakhuvakh se, che nishcho poveche niama da se rodi. No to se sluchi. Osem godini po-k'sno uspiakh da razkazha tazi istoriia.
Samo priemaneto ti pozvoliava da prod'lzhish. Edinstvenite evrei, koito poznavam i sa bili zhertva na onezi godini, se kazvat Danka i Ertman Preis. Zhiveekha prez niakolko k'shchi ot nashata v rodnoto mi Bratsigovo i baba me vodeshe u tiakh na gosti. Khodila s'm v Osvientsim. Poznavakh khora, koito sa bili partizani. V'zroditelniiat protses prez 1984-1985 g. be pred ochite mi. Togava biakh v deseti klas. Imakh s'uchenichki turkini ot Nova makhala. Znaekh kakvo prezhiviavat i kak go izstradvat. Te stoiakha skupcheni krai pechkata v klasnata ni staia i ne iskakha da si sednat zad chinovete. Posle spriakha da idvat na uchilishche mozhe bi za mesets. Ne pomnia dali im pishekha ots'stviia. Ako niakoga Nigiar, Sevginar i Siuzan prochetat tazi kniga, neka znaiat, che ne s'm gi zabravila. Pomnia i goliamoto preselenie prez liatoto na 1989 g. Togava tseli sela opustiavakha, zhitelite im tr'gnakha za Turtsiia, za da se vr'shchat samo po vreme na izbori. Napisakh tozi roman s ideiata, che khorata ne prinadlezhat na razlichni etnosi, a na edna planeta. Niama znachenie kak'v e tsvet't na kozhata im i kak se kazvat. Te sa ednakvi. Khora."­
ªEdin sl'nchev den Iris namira dobre podredeniia p'zel na zhivota si razpr'snat v'rkhu poda - s'prug't i Viktor vnezapno ia napuska, no i otpravia ekzotichno predlozhenie - za paralelna vr'zka s neia i nastoiashchata mu priiatelka.
Iris e razk'svana ot protivorechivi chuvstva - dali da se prev'rne v liubovnitsa na bivshiia si s'prug ili da go zagubi nap'lno? Liubovta i obidata, otchaianieto i bolkata se boriat za nadmoshchie v dushata i, dokato sluchaino ne poluchava dost'p do nai-intimnite zamisli na Viktor. Dobre prikrivanite do tozi moment taini sm'kvat izvedn'zh litsemernata mu maska. Fin, no boleznen plan za otm'shchenie se razhda v glavata na Iris.
Za shchastie v t'rseneto na p'tia sred ruinite na dosegashniia i zhivot Iris ne e sama. Nad neia, kakto dobrite fei v prikazkite, bdiat chetirite i verni priiatelki. A vmesto prints ot minaloto se poiaviava edna stara liubov. Mozhe bi idva da ia spasi? Tova li mislite, che shche se sluchi?
No nali pomnite: vsichko, koeto ni podnasia zhivot't, e BEZ ZAKhAR!
Roman, podnesen bez zakhar i s l'zhichka seks"³
°Devetnaiset omag'osani istorii za porasnali detsa. Noshch, tainstveni kufari, s'nishcha, ochi, neustoimi zheni, m'zhe ubiitsi i poeti i drugi senchesti dumi brodiat iz stranitsite na knigata. Prikazki za melankholichni detsa e sbornik s razkazi i mrachno-magichni istorii za noshchno chetene. Iliustrirano s tematichni fotografii na avtora, tova e chetivo, koeto uvlicha i okoto, s'blazniava, plashi, topli. Kato ubezhishche za tainoliubivi, nespiashchi detsa. Kato v kniga.
Seriia ot snimki, privideniia, obrazi, uloveni ot razkazvacha, pridruzhavat razlichni po dusha prikazki - ot klasicheski barokovo t'mni istorii prez aleno cherveni, khipnotizirani razkazi, bradata na Dante, renesansovi kotki i kufari, p'lni s's seks i uzhas do prikazka-tril'r... po ostrie i po Deivid Linchovski.
Edin poetichen akt v proza."Á
¾Tova e kniga za brat i sestra, za detstvoto i porastvaneto, za priiatelstvoto i semeistvoto, za triumfa i tragediiata i vsichko pomezhdu im.
Tova e i roman za liubovta v'v vsichkite i formi."Å
ÂV kraia na romana "Iazh, moli se i obichai" Elizabet Gilb'rt se vliubva v brazilets s avstraliisko grazhdanstvo, koito pri zapoznanstvoto im zhivee v Indoneziia. Dvamata se premestvat v Amerika i se vrichat edin na drug v'v vechna viarnost, no se zaklevat pri nikakvi obstoiatelstva da ne skliuchvat brak zaradi tezhkiia si opit s predishni razvodi. No edin den Felipe e zad'rzhan na amerikanskata granitsa i poveche niama da mozhe da vliza v stranata, osven ako dvamata s Elizabet ne se ozheniat. S pris'shchite za neia uvlekatelnost, ostroumie i chuvstvo za khumor avtorkata s'postavia razlichni gledni tochki, svatbeni obichai i praktiki prez vekovete, zasiaga problemite na dneshnoto s'zhitelstvo. Otkroveno spodelia lichnite si strakhove i opaseniia ot zakonnoto obv'rzvane i t'rsi otgovor na v'prosa zashcho brachniiat s'iuz ustoiava na vremeto i skeptitsizma na khorata. Liubimkata na tolkova mnogo chitateli po tseliia sviat otnovo e tuk i proslavia liubovta, podtikva ni da se vgledame v intimnostta i da se stremim k'm neia s vsichkata i slozhnost i posledstviia v realniia sviat."Ô
ÑSvet't zad stranitsite ne e toia, koito poznavate. Uchudvaneto i smekh't v tazi kniga izvirat otvsiak'de. V'tre e panoptikum ot khora, otkazali da izgladiat zhivota si, kato sliapa iutiia v r'tsete na S'dbata."à
ÝNai-redkiiat talant v basketbola e kato kometa, koiato raztsepva nebeto, nosena ot svetlinata na svoia blias'k. Tsialata khipnotizirashcha kariera na Maik'l Dzhordan ostavia fenovete, zhurnalistite, bivshite mu tren'ori i s'otbornitsi i dori samiia Dzhordan da se opitvat s godini neistovo da razberat kakvo se sluchi, dokato be na terena.
,,Poniakoga gledam nazad i se chudia dali naistina e bilo realno", kazva vedn'zh toi.
Niama nishcho izv'nzemno. Tova e negovata istoriia."í
êDobre doshli v sveta na mladite i krasivi "Detsa na Niu Iork"!
Tekhnite shokirashchi i bezumno komichni seksualni, liubovni, zhiteiski istorii sa razkazani ot druga obitatelka na Niu Iork, Kandis Bushnel - svetovnoizvestna pisatelka, avtor na bestsel'rite "4 blondinki", "raz-Krachka k'm v'rkha" i "Triumf't na chervilata". Po posledniia si roman s'zdava i stsenarii za nov uspeshen serial "Triumf't na chervilata".
S ostroumie i brutalna otkrovenost Bushnel opisva zhivota na "visoka skorost" v sredite na novoto pokolenie emantsipirani gradski zheni i ekstsentrichni preuspiavashchi m'zhkari.
Zapoznaite se s:
Kari- olitsetvorenie na mlada pisatelka, koiato t'rsi liubovta na nai-nepodkhodiashchi mesta...
Tuzaria- biznes akula, koito se khv'rlia ot vr'zka v'v vr'zka...
Miranda- ambitsiozna advokatka, nastroena sarkastichno k'm tseliia sviat...
Sharlot- nezhna, sladka traditsionalistka, koiato mechtae za dom i detsa...
Samanta- preuspiavashcha chetirideset i niakolko godishna "zhena s testosteron", koiato si sluzhi s's seksa taka, kakto go praviat m'zhete...
I mnogo novi geroi v neochakvani situatsii, razlichni ot filma!"î
ëPrelestta na razkazite na Kherman Khese (1877 - 1962) se koreni v tova, che tezi p'strotsvetni kristali pritezhavat tainata na kapkite rosa - i v nai-malkite si chastitsi te sa ogledalo na bezkrainostta. Pod t'nkoto bulo na esteticheskata kharmoniia v tvorbite na edin ot nai-golemite pisateli na XX vek izvira krasotata na zhivota, no debne i bezumieto na sveta."ö
óLevin, retired from the security services, lives alone in Jerusalem. Adrift, he agrees to follow a friend's wife and discover her secret lover. When she turns to Levin with an unexpected request, his own moral universe is called into question."ù
öB edna malka galeriia v'v Florentsiia peruancki picatel popada na fotoizlozhba za plemeto machigenga. Obraz't na plemenniia razkazvach mu izglezhda cm'tno poznat, napomnia mu na negoviia priiatel ot univerciteta Caul Curatac, micteriozno izcheznal predi godini. Kak tozi peruancki evrein e popadnal v zat'ntenite debri na amazonckata celva? I oshche po-ctranno, zashcho e izbral da ctane razkazvach, pazitel na drevnata pamet na plemeto machigenga?
"Pazkazvach't" na Mario Bargac L'oca e edna neobiknovena ictoriia, v koiato ce preplitat dva glaca: na peruanckiia intelektualets, koito mozhe da ce identifitsira c'c camiia avtor, i na ctranctvashchiia razkazvach ot plemeto machigenga. Pazgledan e cbl'c'k't mezhdu dva razlichni cviata i opitite na c'vremennoto inductrialno obshchectvo da nalozhi cvoite zakoni i poriadki v'rxu c'v'rsheniia v cvoiata primitivnoct cviat na machigengite"ÿ
üChildhood is Bill Cosby country. In this entertaining and endearing book, which ranges from the warmly to the wildly funny, Cosby holds forth with the most marvellous stories he has ever told about his childhood. Here are tales you'll never forget, including his heroic quest for Spanish Fly and his day as a school crossing guard - when he fell dizzily in love that he almost waved his heartthrob under a bus.
Childhood finds Bill Cosby in the territory he knows best: amid the trials of bedtime (fears of bedwetting and the Loch Ness Monster) and the tribulations of bad table manners; coping with the early demise of his children's pets and his own days spent smoking in the boys' room; out on the streets playing stickball; and back home lusting after Wonder Woman.
Youth may be wasted on the young, but Bill Cosby's boyhood - which hasn't completely ended - is an international treasure."	
